{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122199","id":4232936080,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc78TXqQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122199","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122199.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122199.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122199","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122199/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122199/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122199/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5aa842a10544d5aef6cfe2e4cfd80b4b6324fdc6","number":122199,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Use `LocalVector` in `TextEdit`","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nTextEdit now uses LocalVector where it can.\r\nAlso optimized text inserting and removing.\r\n\r\nI made a test project that tests inserting and removing and different ways.\r\nTested on a dev build, from GDScript.\r\nResults are average of 3 runs, in microseconds.\r\n\r\ntest name | master | pr | percent increase\r\n-|-|-|-\r\nAdd all    11000 lines | 2,505,758 | 2,464,400 |   1.68%\r\nRemove indiv 500 lines | 1,590,956 |   583,336 | 172.73%\r\nInsert indiv 500 lines | 2,716,244 | 1,729,802 |  57.03%\r\nRemove cont 9000 lines |   126,451 |   124,580 |   1.50%\r\nInsert cont 9000 lines | 1,103,559 | 1,069,389 |   3.20%\r\nInsert \\n    500 lines | 1,831,433 |   777,491 | 135.56%\r\nReset all  11500 lines | 1,380,656 | 1,357,988 |   1.67%\r\nClear all  11500 lines |   114,547 |   113,255 |   1.14%\r\n\r\nSo mostly inserting and removing individual lines (as opposed to a big block of text), which is from using `std::move`.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nUsed LocalVector for TextEdit gutters, text, carets, and gutter info.\r\nAnd in various methods where possible.\r\nOnly `indent_ofs` needed to be mutable, not the whole text Vector.\r\nCarets are copied for undo/redo but I don't think it is an issue.\r\n\r\nOptimized insert and remove text to use `std::move` \r\nAdded changed checked for `Text::set`.\r\n\r\nReserved in a few places like `get_sorted_carets` and `get_default_word_separators`.\r\n\r\nWhen adding a newline at the start of a line, it is intended that it is the same as adding a line before. So instead of moving the old gutters and hidden state and resetting them on the new line, I swap it instead. This also fixes an issue where the background color wasn't moved too.\r\n\r\nCleaned up `_base_insert_text` too.\r\nThe `p_char` should never be after the line length, and adding one space at a time for it is not very efficient. It can't happen from `_insert`, and undo should always have a valid position in the text, so if it does ever happen, it is probably a bug with the undo system.\r\n\r\nTest project: \r\n[textedit-perf_2026-08-07_22-32-25.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30849262/textedit-perf_2026-08-07_22-32-25.zip)\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/R